  "description": "Transforms any OpenChainGraph artifact JSON into a structured, regulator-framed prompt for any external LLM. Template registry v1.0.0 — one entry per mandate_type with regulatory citations, audience formats, stochastic-framing rules, and escalation conditions. No inference performed; pure template composition.",
